{"id":"2e235e3c68d698c2","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-epsilon-operator.md","title":"Epsilon Operator","display":"df-epsilon-operator — Epsilon Operator","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-epsilon-operator","aliases":["72-df-epsilon-operator"],"display":"df-epsilon-operator — Epsilon Operator","depends_on":["[[72-df-second-order-arithmetic-syntax]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Supplement: Richard Zach, Semantics and Proof Theory of the Epsilon Calculus (2017), §2, https://richardzach.org/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/Zach-2017-Semantics-and-proof-theory-of-the-epsilon-calculus.pdf","verification_status":"reviewed-definition","proof_status":"definition-well-defined","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"source_kind":"supplementary-primary-or-local-derivation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-epsilon-operator"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-epsilon-operator</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-epsilon-operator — Epsilon Operator"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5ae195683ce3beb4\" href=\"?note=5ae195683ce3beb4\" title=\"72-df-second-order-arithmetic-syntax\">72-df-second-order-arithmetic-syntax</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Supplement: Richard Zach, Semantics and Proof Theory of the Epsilon Calculus (2017), §2, <a href=\"https://richardzach.org/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/Zach-2017-Semantics-and-proof-theory-of-the-epsilon-calculus.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://richardzach.org/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/Zach-2017-Semantics-and-proof-theory-of-the-epsilon-calculus.pdf</a>"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed-definition"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"definition-well-defined"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"supplementary-primary-or-local-derivation"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>数变量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_N=\\{x_i:i\\in\\omega\\}\">\\(V_N=\\{x_i:i\\in\\omega\\}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5ae195683ce3beb4\" href=\"?note=5ae195683ce3beb4\" title=\"72-df-second-order-arithmetic-syntax\">72-df-second-order-arithmetic-syntax</a>；只使用数类变量。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 遍历 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,+,\\cdot\">\\(S,+,\\cdot\\)</span>，元数分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1,2,2\">\\(1,2,2\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in\\{=,&lt;\\}\">\\(R\\in\\{=,&lt;\\}\\)</span>。各语法构造子与下文 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{free},\\mathsf{bound}\">\\(\\mathsf{free},\\mathsf{bound}\\)</span> 标签互不相撞。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat T,\\widehat F\">\\(\\widehat T,\\widehat F\\)</span> 是原始有限树；帽号语法中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x_i,0,f,R,\\neg,\\to,Q\">\\(x_i,0,f,R,\\neg,\\to,Q\\)</span> 均表示相应带标签构造子。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t,u\">\\(s,t,u\\)</span> 表示适当类型的树，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\">\\(A,B\\)</span> 表示公式树，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y,z\\in V_N\">\\(x,y,z\\in V_N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists,\\varepsilon\\}\">\\(Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists,\\varepsilon\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}^r,\\operatorname{AV}^r,q,\\operatorname{db}_\\rho,\\operatorname{Sub}^r\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}^r,\\operatorname{AV}^r,q,\\operatorname{db}_\\rho,\\operatorname{Sub}^r\\)</span> 的递归先在原始树上进行；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\\in V_N^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\rho\\in V_N^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> 的第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span> 位是最近绑定变量。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Trm}_\\varepsilon,\\operatorname{Fml}_\\varepsilon\">\\(\\operatorname{Trm}_\\varepsilon,\\operatorname{Fml}_\\varepsilon\\)</span> 再取明确的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> 商。商上的构造子作用于代表元后取类；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_\\varepsilon\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}_\\varepsilon\\)</span> 的输入为一个项或公式类、一个项类及一个自由变量名。向量递归按显示坐标作用。</li>\n<li>新鲜变量在原始树出现的全部变量之外选最小下标；替换按被替换树的大小递归，捕获分支先对真子公式进行新鲜改名。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{q}\">\\(\\operatorname{q}\\)</span> 在任一显式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall,\\exists\">\\(\\forall,\\exists\\)</span> 节点取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span>，并检查 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon\">\\(\\varepsilon\\)</span> 的体；因此无量词片段不隐含任何未展开的量词。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\widehat T_0&amp;:=V_N\\cup\\{0\\},\\qquad \\widehat F_0:=\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\widehat T_{j+1}&amp;:=\\widehat T_j\\cup\\{f(\\vec t):\\vec t\\in\\widehat T_j^{\\operatorname{ar}(f)}\\}\\cup\\{\\varepsilon xA:x\\in V_N,\\ A\\in\\widehat F_j\\},\\\\\n\\widehat F_{j+1}&amp;:=\\widehat F_j\\cup\\{tRu:t,u\\in\\widehat T_j,\\ R\\in\\{=,&lt;\\}\\}\\cup\\{\\neg A:A\\in\\widehat F_j\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{A\\to B:A,B\\in\\widehat F_j\\}\\cup\\{QxA:x\\in V_N,\\ A\\in\\widehat F_j,\\ Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}\\},\\\\\n\\widehat T&amp;:=\\bigcup_{j\\in\\omega}\\widehat T_j,\\qquad \\widehat F:=\\bigcup_{j\\in\\omega}\\widehat F_j.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\widehat T_0&amp;:=V_N\\cup\\{0\\},\\qquad \\widehat F_0:=\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\widehat T_{j+1}&amp;:=\\widehat T_j\\cup\\{f(\\vec t):\\vec t\\in\\widehat T_j^{\\operatorname{ar}(f)}\\}\\cup\\{\\varepsilon xA:x\\in V_N,\\ A\\in\\widehat F_j\\},\\\\\n\\widehat F_{j+1}&amp;:=\\widehat F_j\\cup\\{tRu:t,u\\in\\widehat T_j,\\ R\\in\\{=,&lt;\\}\\}\\cup\\{\\neg A:A\\in\\widehat F_j\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{A\\to B:A,B\\in\\widehat F_j\\}\\cup\\{QxA:x\\in V_N,\\ A\\in\\widehat F_j,\\ Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}\\},\\\\\n\\widehat T&amp;:=\\bigcup_{j\\in\\omega}\\widehat T_j,\\qquad \\widehat F:=\\bigcup_{j\\in\\omega}\\widehat F_j.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{FV}^r(x)&amp;:=\\{x\\},\\quad\\operatorname{FV}^r(0):=\\varnothing,\\quad\\operatorname{FV}^r(f(\\vec t)):=\\bigcup_{i&lt;|\\vec t|}\\operatorname{FV}^r(t_i),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FV}^r(tRu)&amp;:=\\operatorname{FV}^r(t)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}^r(u),\\quad\\operatorname{FV}^r(\\neg A):=\\operatorname{FV}^r(A),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FV}^r(A\\to B)&amp;:=\\operatorname{FV}^r(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}^r(B),\\quad\\operatorname{FV}^r(QxA):=\\operatorname{FV}^r(A)\\setminus\\{x\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{AV}^r(x)&amp;:=\\{x\\},\\quad\\operatorname{AV}^r(0):=\\varnothing,\\quad\\operatorname{AV}^r(f(\\vec t)):=\\bigcup_{i&lt;|\\vec t|}\\operatorname{AV}^r(t_i),\\\\\n\\operatorname{AV}^r(tRu)&amp;:=\\operatorname{AV}^r(t)\\cup\\operatorname{AV}^r(u),\\quad\\operatorname{AV}^r(\\neg A):=\\operatorname{AV}^r(A),\\\\\n\\operatorname{AV}^r(A\\to B)&amp;:=\\operatorname{AV}^r(A)\\cup\\operatorname{AV}^r(B),\\quad\\operatorname{AV}^r(QxA):=\\operatorname{AV}^r(A)\\cup\\{x\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{fresh}(A,t,x,y)&amp;:=x_{\\min\\{i\\in\\omega:x_i\\notin\\operatorname{AV}^r(A)\\cup\\operatorname{AV}^r(t)\\cup\\{x,y\\}\\}}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{FV}^r(x)&amp;:=\\{x\\},\\quad\\operatorname{FV}^r(0):=\\varnothing,\\quad\\operatorname{FV}^r(f(\\vec t)):=\\bigcup_{i&lt;|\\vec t|}\\operatorname{FV}^r(t_i),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FV}^r(tRu)&amp;:=\\operatorname{FV}^r(t)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}^r(u),\\quad\\operatorname{FV}^r(\\neg A):=\\operatorname{FV}^r(A),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FV}^r(A\\to B)&amp;:=\\operatorname{FV}^r(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}^r(B),\\quad\\operatorname{FV}^r(QxA):=\\operatorname{FV}^r(A)\\setminus\\{x\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{AV}^r(x)&amp;:=\\{x\\},\\quad\\operatorname{AV}^r(0):=\\varnothing,\\quad\\operatorname{AV}^r(f(\\vec t)):=\\bigcup_{i&lt;|\\vec t|}\\operatorname{AV}^r(t_i),\\\\\n\\operatorname{AV}^r(tRu)&amp;:=\\operatorname{AV}^r(t)\\cup\\operatorname{AV}^r(u),\\quad\\operatorname{AV}^r(\\neg A):=\\operatorname{AV}^r(A),\\\\\n\\operatorname{AV}^r(A\\to B)&amp;:=\\operatorname{AV}^r(A)\\cup\\operatorname{AV}^r(B),\\quad\\operatorname{AV}^r(QxA):=\\operatorname{AV}^r(A)\\cup\\{x\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{fresh}(A,t,x,y)&amp;:=x_{\\min\\{i\\in\\omega:x_i\\notin\\operatorname{AV}^r(A)\\cup\\operatorname{AV}^r(t)\\cup\\{x,y\\}\\}}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{db}_\\rho(x)&amp;:=\\begin{cases}\\langle\\mathsf{bound},\\min\\{j&lt;|\\rho|:\\rho_j=x\\}\\rangle,&amp;x\\in\\operatorname{ran}(\\rho),\\\\\\langle\\mathsf{free},x\\rangle,&amp;x\\notin\\operatorname{ran}(\\rho),\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\operatorname{db}_\\rho(0)&amp;:=0,\\quad\\operatorname{db}_\\rho(f(\\vec t)):=\\langle f,\\langle\\operatorname{db}_\\rho(t_i)\\rangle_{i&lt;|\\vec t|}\\rangle,\\\\\n\\operatorname{db}_\\rho(tRu)&amp;:=\\langle R,\\operatorname{db}_\\rho(t),\\operatorname{db}_\\rho(u)\\rangle,\\quad\\operatorname{db}_\\rho(\\neg A):=\\langle\\neg,\\operatorname{db}_\\rho(A)\\rangle,\\\\\n\\operatorname{db}_\\rho(A\\to B)&amp;:=\\langle\\to,\\operatorname{db}_\\rho(A),\\operatorname{db}_\\rho(B)\\rangle,\\quad\\operatorname{db}_\\rho(QxA):=\\langle Q,\\operatorname{db}_{\\langle x\\rangle^\\frown\\rho}(A)\\rangle,\\\\\ns\\sim_\\alpha t&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\bigl((s,t\\in\\widehat T)\\lor(s,t\\in\\widehat F)\\bigr)\\land\\operatorname{db}_{\\langle\\rangle}(s)=\\operatorname{db}_{\\langle\\rangle}(t),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Trm}_\\varepsilon&amp;:=\\widehat T/{\\sim_\\alpha},\\quad\\operatorname{Fml}_\\varepsilon:=\\widehat F/{\\sim_\\alpha},\\quad\\operatorname{FV}_\\varepsilon([s]_\\alpha):=\\operatorname{FV}^r(s).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{db}_\\rho(x)&amp;:=\\begin{cases}\\langle\\mathsf{bound},\\min\\{j&lt;|\\rho|:\\rho_j=x\\}\\rangle,&amp;x\\in\\operatorname{ran}(\\rho),\\\\\\langle\\mathsf{free},x\\rangle,&amp;x\\notin\\operatorname{ran}(\\rho),\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\operatorname{db}_\\rho(0)&amp;:=0,\\quad\\operatorname{db}_\\rho(f(\\vec t)):=\\langle f,\\langle\\operatorname{db}_\\rho(t_i)\\rangle_{i&lt;|\\vec t|}\\rangle,\\\\\n\\operatorname{db}_\\rho(tRu)&amp;:=\\langle R,\\operatorname{db}_\\rho(t),\\operatorname{db}_\\rho(u)\\rangle,\\quad\\operatorname{db}_\\rho(\\neg A):=\\langle\\neg,\\operatorname{db}_\\rho(A)\\rangle,\\\\\n\\operatorname{db}_\\rho(A\\to B)&amp;:=\\langle\\to,\\operatorname{db}_\\rho(A),\\operatorname{db}_\\rho(B)\\rangle,\\quad\\operatorname{db}_\\rho(QxA):=\\langle Q,\\operatorname{db}_{\\langle x\\rangle^\\frown\\rho}(A)\\rangle,\\\\\ns\\sim_\\alpha t&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\bigl((s,t\\in\\widehat T)\\lor(s,t\\in\\widehat F)\\bigr)\\land\\operatorname{db}_{\\langle\\rangle}(s)=\\operatorname{db}_{\\langle\\rangle}(t),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Trm}_\\varepsilon&amp;:=\\widehat T/{\\sim_\\alpha},\\quad\\operatorname{Fml}_\\varepsilon:=\\widehat F/{\\sim_\\alpha},\\quad\\operatorname{FV}_\\varepsilon([s]_\\alpha):=\\operatorname{FV}^r(s).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Sub}^r(x,t,x)&amp;:=t,\\quad\\operatorname{Sub}^r(y,t,x):=y\\ (y\\ne x),\\quad\\operatorname{Sub}^r(0,t,x):=0,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Sub}^r(\\langle u_i\\rangle_{i&lt;k},t,x)&amp;:=\\langle\\operatorname{Sub}^r(u_i,t,x)\\rangle_{i&lt;k},\\quad\\operatorname{Sub}^r(f(\\vec u),t,x):=f(\\operatorname{Sub}^r(\\vec u,t,x)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Sub}^r(uRv,t,x)&amp;:=\\operatorname{Sub}^r(u,t,x)R\\operatorname{Sub}^r(v,t,x),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Sub}^r(\\neg A,t,x)&amp;:=\\neg\\operatorname{Sub}^r(A,t,x),\\quad\\operatorname{Sub}^r(A\\to B,t,x):=\\operatorname{Sub}^r(A,t,x)\\to\\operatorname{Sub}^r(B,t,x),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Sub}^r(QyA,t,x)&amp;:=\\begin{cases}QyA,&amp;y=x,\\\\Qy\\operatorname{Sub}^r(A,t,x),&amp;y\\ne x\\land y\\notin\\operatorname{FV}^r(t),\\\\Qz\\operatorname{Sub}^r(\\operatorname{Sub}^r(A,z,y),t,x),&amp;y\\ne x\\land y\\in\\operatorname{FV}^r(t),\\ z=\\operatorname{fresh}(A,t,x,y),\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\operatorname{Sub}_\\varepsilon([s]_\\alpha,[t]_\\alpha,x)&amp;:=[\\operatorname{Sub}^r(s,t,x)]_\\alpha,\\qquad A[t/x]:=\\operatorname{Sub}_\\varepsilon(A,t,x).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Sub}^r(x,t,x)&amp;:=t,\\quad\\operatorname{Sub}^r(y,t,x):=y\\ (y\\ne x),\\quad\\operatorname{Sub}^r(0,t,x):=0,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Sub}^r(\\langle u_i\\rangle_{i&lt;k},t,x)&amp;:=\\langle\\operatorname{Sub}^r(u_i,t,x)\\rangle_{i&lt;k},\\quad\\operatorname{Sub}^r(f(\\vec u),t,x):=f(\\operatorname{Sub}^r(\\vec u,t,x)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Sub}^r(uRv,t,x)&amp;:=\\operatorname{Sub}^r(u,t,x)R\\operatorname{Sub}^r(v,t,x),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Sub}^r(\\neg A,t,x)&amp;:=\\neg\\operatorname{Sub}^r(A,t,x),\\quad\\operatorname{Sub}^r(A\\to B,t,x):=\\operatorname{Sub}^r(A,t,x)\\to\\operatorname{Sub}^r(B,t,x),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Sub}^r(QyA,t,x)&amp;:=\\begin{cases}QyA,&amp;y=x,\\\\Qy\\operatorname{Sub}^r(A,t,x),&amp;y\\ne x\\land y\\notin\\operatorname{FV}^r(t),\\\\Qz\\operatorname{Sub}^r(\\operatorname{Sub}^r(A,z,y),t,x),&amp;y\\ne x\\land y\\in\\operatorname{FV}^r(t),\\ z=\\operatorname{fresh}(A,t,x,y),\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\operatorname{Sub}_\\varepsilon([s]_\\alpha,[t]_\\alpha,x)&amp;:=[\\operatorname{Sub}^r(s,t,x)]_\\alpha,\\qquad A[t/x]:=\\operatorname{Sub}_\\varepsilon(A,t,x).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nq(x)&amp;:=0,\\quad q(0):=0,\\quad q(f(\\vec t)):=\\max\\bigl(\\{0\\}\\cup\\{q(t_i):i&lt;|\\vec t|\\}\\bigr),\\\\\nq(tRu)&amp;:=\\max(q(t),q(u)),\\quad q(\\neg A):=q(A),\\quad q(A\\to B):=\\max(q(A),q(B)),\\\\\nq(\\forall xA)&amp;:=1,\\quad q(\\exists xA):=1,\\quad q(\\varepsilon xA):=q(A),\\\\\n\\operatorname{QTrm}_\\varepsilon&amp;:=\\{[t]_\\alpha:t\\in\\widehat T,\\ q(t)=0\\},\\quad\\operatorname{QFml}_\\varepsilon:=\\{[A]_\\alpha:A\\in\\widehat F,\\ q(A)=0\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Sent}_\\varepsilon&amp;:=\\{A\\in\\operatorname{Fml}_\\varepsilon:\\operatorname{FV}_\\varepsilon(A)=\\varnothing\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{EpsTerm}&amp;:=\\{\\varepsilon xA:x\\in V_N,\\ A\\in\\operatorname{Fml}_\\varepsilon\\},\\quad\\operatorname{EpsClosed}:=\\{e\\in\\operatorname{EpsTerm}:\\operatorname{FV}_\\varepsilon(e)=\\varnothing\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Crit}_\\varepsilon&amp;:=\\{A[t/x]\\to A[\\varepsilon xA/x]:A\\in\\operatorname{Fml}_\\varepsilon,\\ t\\in\\operatorname{Trm}_\\varepsilon,\\ x\\in V_N\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nq(x)&amp;:=0,\\quad q(0):=0,\\quad q(f(\\vec t)):=\\max\\bigl(\\{0\\}\\cup\\{q(t_i):i&lt;|\\vec t|\\}\\bigr),\\\\\nq(tRu)&amp;:=\\max(q(t),q(u)),\\quad q(\\neg A):=q(A),\\quad q(A\\to B):=\\max(q(A),q(B)),\\\\\nq(\\forall xA)&amp;:=1,\\quad q(\\exists xA):=1,\\quad q(\\varepsilon xA):=q(A),\\\\\n\\operatorname{QTrm}_\\varepsilon&amp;:=\\{[t]_\\alpha:t\\in\\widehat T,\\ q(t)=0\\},\\quad\\operatorname{QFml}_\\varepsilon:=\\{[A]_\\alpha:A\\in\\widehat F,\\ q(A)=0\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Sent}_\\varepsilon&amp;:=\\{A\\in\\operatorname{Fml}_\\varepsilon:\\operatorname{FV}_\\varepsilon(A)=\\varnothing\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{EpsTerm}&amp;:=\\{\\varepsilon xA:x\\in V_N,\\ A\\in\\operatorname{Fml}_\\varepsilon\\},\\quad\\operatorname{EpsClosed}:=\\{e\\in\\operatorname{EpsTerm}:\\operatorname{FV}_\\varepsilon(e)=\\varnothing\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Crit}_\\varepsilon&amp;:=\\{A[t/x]\\to A[\\varepsilon xA/x]:A\\in\\operatorname{Fml}_\\varepsilon,\\ t\\in\\operatorname{Trm}_\\varepsilon,\\ x\\in V_N\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>有限阶段同时生成项和公式。绑定位置编码给出独立于“规范改名”文字约定的 α 等价关系；FV、量词标记及替换结果的 α 类不依赖代表元。替换使用新鲜变量，因此允许全部项作为代入输入。ε 是项构造子；显式存在量词与全称量词的联系由 ε 算术的逻辑公理规定。这里没有加入 ε 外延公理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-second-order-arithmetic-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"5ae195683ce3beb4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-second-order-arithmetic-syntax]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-second-order-arithmetic-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"5ae195683ce3beb4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"数变量 $V_N=\\{x_i:i\\in\\omega\\}$ 取 [[72-df-second-order-arithmetic-syntax]]；只使用数类变量。$f$ 遍历 $S,+,\\cdot$，元数分别为 $1,2,2$；$R\\in\\{=,<\\}$。各语法构造子与下文 $\\mathsf{free},\\mathsf{bound}$ 标签互不相撞。$\\widehat T,\\widehat F$ 是原始有限树；帽号语法中的 $x_i,0,f,R,\\neg,\\to,Q$ 均表示相应带标签构造子。$s,t,u$ 表示适当类型的树，$A,B$ 表示公式树，$x,y,z\\in V_N$，$Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists,\\varepsilon\\}$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"V_N=\\{