torname{FV}^r(\\neg A):=\\operatorname{FV}^r(A),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FV}^r(A\\to B)&:=\\operatorname{FV}^r(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}^r(B),\\quad\\operatorname{FV}^r(QxA):=\\operatorname{FV}^r(A)\\setminus\\{x\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{AV}^r(x)&:=\\{x\\},\\quad\\operatorname{AV}^r(0):=\\varnothing,\\quad\\operatorname{AV}^r(f(\\vec t)):=\\bigcup_{i<|\\vec t|}\\operatorname{AV}^r(t_i),\\\\\n\\operatorname{AV}^r(tRu)&:=\\operatorname{AV}^r(t)\\cup\\operatorname{AV}^r(u),\\quad\\operatorname{AV}^r(\\neg A):=\\operatorname{AV}^r(A),\\\\\n\\operatorname{AV}^r(A\\to B)&:=\\operatorname{AV}^r(A)\\cup\\operatorname{AV}^r(B),\\quad\\operatorname{AV}^r(QxA):=\\operatorname{AV}^r(A)\\cup\\{x\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{fresh}(A,t,x,y)&:=x_{\\min\\{i\\in\\omega:x_i\\notin\\operatorname{AV}^r(A)\\cup\\operatorname{AV}^r(t)\\cup\\{x,y\\}\\}}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{db}_\\rho(x)&:=\\begin{cases}\\langle\\mathsf{bound},\\min\\{j<|\\rho|:\\rho_j=x\\}\\rangle,&x\\in\\operatorname{ran}(\\rho),\\\\\\langle\\mathsf{free},x\\rangle,&x\\notin\\operatorname{ran}(\\rho),\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\operatorname{db}_\\rho(0)&:=0,\\quad\\operatorname{db}_\\rho(f(\\vec t)):=\\langle f,\\langle\\operatorname{db}_\\rho(t_i)\\rangle_{i<|\\vec t|}\\rangle,\\\\\n\\operatorname{db}_\\rho(tRu)&:=\\langle R,\\operatorname{db}_\\rho(t),\\operatorname{db}_\\rho(u)\\rangle,\\quad\\operatorname{db}_\\rho(\\neg A):=\\langle\\neg,\\operatorname{db}_\\rho(A)\\rangle,\\\\\n\\operatorname{db}_\\rho(A\\to B)&:=\\langle\\to,\\operatorname{db}_\\rho(A),\\operatorname{db}_\\rho(B)\\rangle,\\quad\\operatorname{db}_\\rho(QxA):=\\langle Q,\\operatorname{db}_{\\langle x\\rangle^\\frown\\rho}(A)\\rangle,\\\\\ns\\sim_\\alpha t&:\\Longleftrightarrow\\bigl((s,t\\in\\widehat T)\\lor(s,t\\in\\widehat F)\\bigr)\\land\\operatorname{db}_{\\langle\\rangle}(s)=\\operatorname{db}_{\\langle\\rangle}(t),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Trm}_\\varepsilon&:=\\widehat T/{\\sim_\\alpha},\\quad\\operatorname{Fml}_\\varepsilon:=\\widehat F/{\\sim_\\alpha},\\quad\\operatorname{FV}_\\varepsilon([s]_\\alpha):=\\operatorname{FV}^r(s).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Sub}^r(x,t,x)&:=t,\\quad\\operatorname{Sub}^r(y,t,x):=y\\ (y\\ne x),\\quad\\operatorname{Sub}^r(0,t,x):=0,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Sub}^r(\\langle u_i\\rangle_{i<k},t,x)&:=\\langle\\operatorname{Sub}^r(u_i,t,x)\\rangle_{i<k},\\quad\\operatorname{Sub}^r(f(\\vec u),t,x):=f(\\operatorname{Sub}^r(\\vec u,t,x)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Sub}^r(uRv,t,x)&:=\\operatorname{Sub}^r(u,t,x)R\\operatorname{Sub}^r(v,t,x),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Sub}^r(\\neg A,t,x)&:=\\neg\\operatorname{Sub}^r(A,t,x),\\quad\\operatorname{Sub}^r(A\\to B,t,x):=\\operatorname{Sub}^r(A,t,x)\\to\\operatorname{Sub}^r(B,t,x),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Sub}^r(QyA,t,x)&:=\\begin{cases}QyA,&y=x,\\\\Qy\\operatorname{Sub}^r(A,t,x),&y\\ne x\\land y\\notin\\operatorname{FV}^r(t),\\\\Qz\\operatorname{Sub}^r(\\operatorname{Sub}^r(A,z,y),t,x),&y\\ne x\\land y\\in\\operatorname{FV}^r(t),\\ z=\\operatorname{fresh}(A,t,x,y),\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\operatorname{Sub}_\\varepsilon([s]_\\alpha,[t]_\\alpha,x)&:=[\\operatorname{Sub}^r(s,t,x)]_\\alpha,\\qquad A[t/x]:=\\operatorname{Sub}_\\varepsilon(A,t,x).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nq(x)&:=0,\\quad q(0):=0,\\quad q(f(\\vec t)):=\\max\\bigl(\\{0\\}\\cup\\{q(t_i):i<|\\vec t|\\}\\bigr),\\\\\nq(tRu)&:=\\max(q(t),q(u)),\\quad q(\\neg A):=q(A),\\quad q(A\\to B):=\\max(q(A),q(B)),\\\\\nq(\\forall xA)&:=1,\\quad q(\\exists xA):=1,\\quad q(\\varepsilon xA):=q(A),\\\\\n\\operatorname{QTrm}_\\varepsilon&:=\\{[t]_\\alpha:t\\in\\widehat T,\\ q(t)=0\\},\\quad\\operatorname{QFml}_\\varepsilon:=\\{[A]_\\alpha:A\\in\\widehat F,\\ q(A)=0\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Sent}_\\varepsilon&:=\\{A\\in\\operatorname{Fml}_\\varepsilon:\\operatorname{FV}_\\varepsilon(A)=\\varnothing\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{EpsTerm}&:=\\{\\varepsilon xA:x\\in V_N,\\ A\\in\\operatorname{Fml}_\\varepsilon\\},\\quad\\operatorname{EpsClosed}:=\\{e\\in\\operatorname{EpsTerm}:\\operatorname{FV}_\\varepsilon(e)=\\varnothing\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Crit}_\\varepsilon&:=\\{A[t/x]\\to A[\\varepsilon xA/x]:A\\in\\operatorname{Fml}_\\varepsilon,\\ t\\in\\operatorname{Trm}_\\varepsilon,\\ x\\in V_N\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":7162,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-259","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-epsilon-operator|df-epsilon-operator — Epsilon Operator]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-257","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[df-epsilon-operator — Epsilon Operator](72-df-epsilon-operator.md)"},{"id":"0fa05bc95319d815","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"ε 语法、$\\alpha$ 商、$\\operatorname{Sub}_\\varepsilon$、$\\operatorname{Sent}_\\varepsilon$、$\\operatorname{Crit}_\\varepsilon$ 取 [[72-df-epsilon-operator]]；$\\mathcal P,\\operatorname{Taut}$ 取 [[72-df-two-sorted-derivability]] 的命题语法及真值定义。$h\\in\\operatorname{Fml}_\\varepsilon^\\omega$，$A,B\\in\\operatorname{Fml}_\\varepsilon$，$s,t\\in\\operatorname{Trm}_\\varepsilon$，$x\\in V_N$。全部对象替换使用 $\\operatorname{Sub}_\\varepsilon$。"},{"id":"a5264e1ed228195f","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"语法取 [[72-df-epsilon-operator]]。$E$ 为 $\\operatorname{EpsClosed}$ 到 $\\omega$ 的有限部分函数；不在域内的ε项默认取0。$\\operatorname{ev}_E$ 对闭无量词项/公式按外部语法递归，遇ε项直接查E，不递归评价它的body。"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-275","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-epsilon-operator|df-epsilon-operator — Epsilon Operator]]"},{"id":"29de2a641cbd0b98","anchor":"ref-85","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-df-epsilon-operator]]"}],"outgoing":["5ae195683ce3beb4"]}